| `nexus-key-line` `:266-268` | floor-plain | ''F:'' public hand-over keys/signatures. |
| `carriage-admit` `:269-271` | floor-plain | ''F:'' public gate reach/pin. |
| `sealed-rest` `:275-277` | floor-plain | ''F carriage:'' sealed lockboxes, signed records and indexes remain opaque transport; cryptographic content ownership stays with the relevant face's Keyhive/content-key seat. The row is not an FCK escrow. |
